# Customers module. Endpoints require a role; until the auth module (#132) is merged,
# authenticate with a JWT issued by it (Authorization: Bearer ...).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@customerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a person
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Person",
  "firstName": "Ján",
  "lastName": "Novák",
  "email": "jan.novak@example.sk",
  "phone": "+421 900 123 456",
  "address": { "street": "Hlavná 12", "city": "Bratislava", "postalCode": "811 01" }
}

### Create a company (IČO with check digit is required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Company",
  "companyName": "Slnko s.r.o.",
  "ico": "35763469",
  "dic": "2020273893",
  "icDph": "SK2020273893",
  "email": "info@slnko.sk",
  "address": { "street": "Priemyselná 5", "city": "Trnava", "postalCode": "917 01" }
}

### Get a customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a customer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Person",
  "firstName": "Ján",
  "lastName": "Novák",
  "email": "jan.novak@example.sk",
  "address": { "street": "Hlavná 14", "city": "Bratislava", "postalCode": "811 01" }
}

### Archive / reactivate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
